cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the associated article."
title: "First-Trimester Heat Stress and Miscarriage in 21 Low- and Middle-Income Countries: Analysis and Visualisation Code"
type: software
version: 0.1.2
license: MIT
abstract: "R scripts for the 21-country discrete-time survival analysis of first-trimester heat exposure and miscarriage using Demographic and Health Surveys, including potential impact fractions and quantile g-computation mixture analyses. Private preconstructed analytic inputs are required."
keywords:
  - heat exposure
  - miscarriage
  - discrete-time survival analysis
  - Demographic and Health Surveys
  - climate and health
